  "label": "User projected onto the man at the Hall of Fame event",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man at the Hall of Fame event. The meme uses self-referential humor where the text 'back to the... hall of fame' implies the man is being honored or returning, creating an implicit identification with the subject. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the framing invites the user to identify with the subject of the honor, making the man the focal point of the projection.",
